stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT : MR creado
    DRAFT --> READY_FOR_REVIEW : implementacion completa
    READY_FOR_REVIEW --> CHANGES_REQUESTED : review con hallazgos
    CHANGES_REQUESTED --> READY_FOR_REVIEW : correcciones aplicadas
    READY_FOR_REVIEW --> APPROVED : revision aprobada
    APPROVED --> MERGEABLE : checks y branch protection
    MERGEABLE --> MERGED : merge autorizado
    MERGED --> DEPLOYED : deploy verificado
    READY_FOR_REVIEW --> CLOSED : cancelado
    CHANGES_REQUESTED --> CLOSED : cancelado
    note right of APPROVED
      APPROVED no implica MERGEABLE:
      pueden faltar checks, approvals o protecciones.
    end note
    note right of DEPLOYED
      DEPLOYED es un estado interno de AI Hub.
      En GitLab el MR ya esta MERGED.
    end note
